<Positioned left="1168" top="1688" width="520"><Container alignment="CENTER_RIGHT"><Text fontSize="13" color="#6B6152FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">temperatures are illustrative for a fictional bakery</Text></Container></Positioned>
